                "description": "Fusion 23-C8, Cobalt Glass Knob With Victorian Rose -- The dynamic shape of Fusion Hardware's Cobalt Glass Knob is enhanced by the ornate Victorian Rose, making this knobset a sparkling reminder of a time past. Available in 6 finishes, it will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
